This local collection consolidates code and guidance from these adjacent repositories:

1. ai-automation
   Source: https://github.com/typeonce-dev/ai-automation
   Copied: rules/oxlint/src/rules and selected guidance documents.
   No license file was present in the checked-out source on 2026-08-12. Retain
   this provenance when redistributing until the upstream license is confirmed.

2. anti-slop
   Source: https://github.com/dmmulroy/anti-slop
   Copied: src/rules and src/shared.
   License: MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Dillon Mulroy.

3. slopocop
   Source: https://github.com/LBognanni/slopocop
   Ported: its custom ESLint rules to OXLint in src/rules. The OXLint ports are
   new local implementations that preserve the documented rule intent.
   License: MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Loris Bognanni.

